#. front matter: title
#: content/ja/blog/c-relu-function/index.md:2
msgid "【C言語】ReLU関数の実装"
msgstr "[C] Implementing the ReLU Function"

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/c-relu-function/index.md:12
msgid ""
"ReLU関数は、機械学習やニューラルネットワークなどの分野でよく使用される関数で"
"す。ランプ関数とも言います。"
msgstr ""
"The ReLU function is commonly used in fields such as machine learning and "
"neural networks. It is also known as the ramp function."

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/c-relu-function/index.md:14
msgid "ここでは、C言語でReLU関数を実装する方法について、解説します。"
msgstr "This article explains how to implement the ReLU function in C."

#. heading (level 2)
#: content/ja/blog/c-relu-function/index.md:16
msgid "ReLU関数とは"
msgstr "What Is the ReLU Function?"

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/c-relu-function/index.md:18
msgid ""
"ReLU関数は、ニューラルネットワークにおいて最も一般的に使われる活性化関数の一"
"つです。この関数は、入力が \\\\( 0 \\\\) 以下の場合は出力が \\\\( 0 \\\\) "
"で、\\\\( 0 \\\\) より大きい場合は入力をそのまま出力します。"
msgstr ""
"The ReLU function is one of the most commonly used activation functions in "
"neural networks. It outputs \\\\( 0 \\\\) when the input is less than or "
"equal to \\\\( 0 \\\\), and outputs the input unchanged when it is greater "
"than \\\\( 0 \\\\)."

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/c-relu-function/index.md:20
msgid "具体的には、ReLU関数は以下の式で表されます。"
msgstr "Specifically, the ReLU function is expressed by the following formula."

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/c-relu-function/index.md:22
msgid "\\\\[ f(x) = max(0, x) \\\\]"
msgstr "\\\\[ f(x) = max(0, x) \\\\]"

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/c-relu-function/index.md:24
msgid ""
"ここで、 \\\\( x \\\\) は入力値であり、 \\\\( f(x) \\\\) はReLU関数の出力値で"
"す。"
msgstr ""
"Here, \\\\( x \\\\) is the input value and \\\\( f(x) \\\\) is the output "
"value of the ReLU function."

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/c-relu-function/index.md:26
msgid "![ReLU関数](images/relu-function.webp)"
msgstr "![ReLU function](images/relu-function.webp)"

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/c-relu-function/index.md:28
msgid ""
"ReLU関数は、シンプルで計算が効率的であることが特徴です。ニューラルネットワー"
"クにおいて非線形な特徴マップを生成することができるため、深層学習において広く"
"使用されています。"
msgstr ""
"The ReLU function is simple and computationally efficient. Because it can "
"produce nonlinear feature maps in neural networks, it is widely used in deep "
"learning."

#. heading (level 2)
#: content/ja/blog/c-relu-function/index.md:30
msgid "ReLU関数の実装"
msgstr "Implementing the ReLU Function"

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/c-relu-function/index.md:32
msgid "以下に、ReLU関数の実装例を示します。"
msgstr "Below is an example implementation of the ReLU function."

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/c-relu-function/index.md:41
msgid ""
"`relu`関数は、引数として \\\\( x \\\\) を受け取り、ReLU関数の計算結果を戻り値"
"として返します。"
msgstr ""
"The `relu` function takes \\\\( x \\\\) as an argument and returns the "
"result of the ReLU function as its return value."
